#: ../../api/types/affiliate_info.rst:3
msgid "AffiliateInfo"
msgstr "AffiliateInfo"

#: litegram.types.affiliate_info.AffiliateInfo:1 of
msgid ""
"Contains information about the affiliate that received a commission via this "
"transaction."
msgstr ""
"Содержит информацию о партнёре, получившем комиссию по этой транзакции."

#: litegram.types.affiliate_info.AffiliateInfo:3 of
msgid "Source: https://core.telegram.org/bots/api#affiliateinfo"
msgstr "Источник: https://core.telegram.org/bots/api#affiliateinfo"

#: ../../docstring
#: litegram.types.affiliate_info.AffiliateInfo.commission_per_mille:1 of
msgid ""
"The number of Telegram Stars received by the affiliate for each 1000 Telegram"
" Stars received by the bot from referred users"
msgstr ""
"Число Telegram Stars, получаемое партнёром за каждые 1000 Telegram Stars, "
"полученных ботом от привлечённых пользователей"

#: ../../docstring litegram.types.affiliate_info.AffiliateInfo.amount:1 of
msgid ""
"Integer amount of Telegram Stars received by the affiliate from the "
"transaction, rounded to 0; can be negative for refunds"
msgstr ""
"Целое число Telegram Stars, полученное партнёром по транзакции, округлённое "
"до 0; может быть отрицательным для возвратов"

#: ../../docstring litegram.types.affiliate_info.AffiliateInfo.affiliate_user:1
#: of
msgid ""
"*Optional*. The bot or the user that received an affiliate commission if it "
"was received by a bot or a user"
msgstr ""
"*Необязательно*. Бот или пользователь, получивший партнёрскую комиссию, если "
"она была получена ботом или пользователем"

#: ../../docstring litegram.types.affiliate_info.AffiliateInfo.affiliate_chat:1
#: of
msgid ""
"*Optional*. The chat that received an affiliate commission if it was received"
" by a chat"
msgstr ""
"*Необязательно*. Чат, получивший партнёрскую комиссию, если она была получена"
" чатом"

#: ../../docstring
#: litegram.types.affiliate_info.AffiliateInfo.nanostar_amount:1 of
msgid ""
"*Optional*. The number of 1/1000000000 shares of Telegram Stars received by "
"the affiliate; from -999999999 to 999999999; can be negative for refunds"
msgstr ""
"*Необязательно*. Число долей 1/1000000000 от Telegram Stars, полученное "
"партнёром; от -999999999 до 999999999; может быть отрицательным для возвратов"
